{"ts": "2026-09-11T20:55:30+0000", "kind": "history_signal", "schema_version": "attest.history-signal.v1", "task_id": "20260911-205450-92f2c997", "finding_id": "f7337f65e2", "file": "services/market_gateway/src/us_stock_helper_market_gateway/opend_adapter.py", "line": 518, "lookback_commits": 50, "triggered": false, "commit_sha": "897b101692b14e5deca5795ecb4fc493c1da23f2", "commit_message": "market_gateway: available_at tracks receive clock, not theoretical bar close\n\nFixes the lookahead-bias defect flagged in the roadmap: candle available_at\nand received_at were derived from the bar's theoretical close time, which\ncan be earlier than when this gateway actually received the row. Both now\ncome from the receive-clock reading taken right after the OpenD response\nlands.\n\nGate: bash scripts/test_changed.sh is red, but only via two pre-existing\ncontract-fixture tests unrelated to this change (verified with git stash\nagainst the pre-fix tree). Diagnosis and a new queue item are in\ndocs/backlog.md; this item stays unchecked until that's resolved.", "priced": false}
